4.	Percentage of sex workers reached with HIV prevention programs - defined package of services (39.38%) &#x2013; Baseline of 2019
5.	Percentage of sex workers that have received an HIV test during the reporting period and know their results (20.92%) &#x2013; Baseline of 2019
6.	Percentage of PLHIV on ART who initiated TB preventive therapy among those eligible during the reporting period (75%) &#x2013; Baseline of 2019
7.	Percentage of people living with HIV newly initiated on ART who were screened for TB (100%) &#x2013; Baseline of 2019
8.	Percentage of HIV-positive results among the total HIV tests performed during the reporting period (1.57%)&#x2013; Baseline of 2019
9.	Timeliness of facility reporting: Percentage of submitted facility monthly reports (for the reporting period) that are received on time per the national guidelines (66.%) &#x2013; Baseline of 2019</narrative>
